# Claude Code's local-only state: sub-agent worktrees (isolation:
# "worktree") and per-machine settings. Per-skill markdown files
# committed under `.claude/skills/` are tracked — see VA-410's
# /triage skill. We use targeted ignores rather than a blanket
# `.claude/` ignore because gitignore re-includes (`!path`) don't
# apply when a parent directory is already excluded.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
